#: workspace.cpp:1847
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Introductory text shown in the support information."
msgid ""
"KWin Support Information:\n"
"The following information should be used when requesting support on e.g. https://discuss.kde.org.\n"
"It provides information about the currently running instance, which options are used,\n"
"what OpenGL driver and which effects are running.\n"
"Please post the information provided underneath this introductory text to a paste bin service\n"
"like https://paste.kde.org instead of pasting into support threads.\n"
msgstr ""
"Podaci o podršci za KWin:\n"
"Sljedeće podatke treba upotrijebiti pri traženju podrške npr. na https://discuss.kde.org.\n"
"Pružaju informacije o trenutno pokrenutom primjerku, koje se opcije koriste,\n"
"koji OpenGL upravljački program i koji se efekti izvode.\n"
"Molimo objavite podatke ispod ovog uvodnog teksta na neku pastebin uslugu\n"
"poput https://paste.kde.org umjesto stvaranja velikih poruka u dretvama podrške.\n"

